'' TKO0907: A NAME THAT IS A SEGMENT OF AN IMPORT'S PATH, BUT NOT ITS ALIAS, is TKO0743 with
'' a note at the import naming the alias -- '#import "std/strings"' then 'std.replace'. No
'' note for a name no import spells. ADR 0017; RFC-0002 §2.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc -i tests/modules/src/iface/libs tests/diagnostics/src/modules/alias/segment.bas -o tests/diagnostics/aliassegment.exe
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: segment.bas(5,7): error TKO0743: 'net' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: segment.bas(3,1): note: did you mean 'http'? '#import "acme/net/http"' binds the name 'http'
'' EXPECT-OUT: segment.bas(6,7): error TKO0743: 'esc' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: segment.bas(4,1): note: did you mean 'e'? '#import "acme/text/esc"' binds the name 'e'
'' EXPECT-OUT: segment.bas(7,7): error TKO0743: 'zz' is not declared
'' EXPECT-NOT: did you mean 'zz'
